  "description": "Fast. Agile. Sharp.It’s more than just a tagline. The IZZO CORE 4 is a bike with precision at the heart of its design, engineered to crush your personal bests and destroy your preconceived ideas of what a trail bike can achieve. From the moment you put the power down, the sleek 130mm frame comes alive – we built the IZZO for all-day epics, your local loop, and everything in between. Sitting at the pinnacle of the range, this model leverages the most performance-driven components available, including the cutting-edge Shimano XT Di2 wireless drivetrain, a next-gen FOX 36 Factory SL fork, and a healthy dose of carbon fiber from Raceface and DT Swiss.",
